                <pb facs="0296" n="286" sameAs="frus:frus1864p1/pg286"/>

                <p rendition="#center">[Enclosure 10 in No. 11.]</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Register.</hi></p>
                <p>I, the undersigned registrar of the port of Cape Town, hereby certify that the
                    Saxon (215–69 tons)—official number, 37,024—port number, 1—was on the 9th day of
                    February, 1863, duly registered at this port, in the name of William James
                    Anderson.</p>
                <p>Given under my hand, at Cape Town, Cape of Good Hope, this 15th day of December,
                    1863.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. T. FISH, <hi rendition="#italic">Registrar.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
